    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oars of Silence</strong> is a brutal, minimalist survival horror adventure set in the endless dark sea. Armed with only a rowboat, you must navigate through open ocean, unpredictable weather, and the strange creatures that seem to awaken in the deep as the world grows quieter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique rowing mechanism where your left click controls the left oar and right click rows with the right-hand oar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigation using a compass and radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing for food so you can row faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >escaping the dangers of the sea, whatever they may be</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oars of Silence</strong> is a brutal, minimalist survival horror adventure set in the endless dark sea. Armed with only a rowboat, you must navigate through open ocean, unpredictable weather, and the strange creatures that seem to awaken in the deep as the world grows quieter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique rowing mechanism where your left click controls the left oar and right click rows with the right-hand oar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigation using a compass and radio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing for food so you can row faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >escaping the dangers of the sea, whatever they may be</p></li></ul>",
